{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"partition","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"belongsInSecondPartition","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/BidirectionalCollection\/Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:SK7ElementQa","text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rethrows","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/BidirectionalCollection\/Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:SK5IndexQa","text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A predicate used to partition"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the collection. All elements satisfying this predicate are ordered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after all elements not satisfying it."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"belongsInSecondPartition"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The index of the first element in the reordered collection","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that matches ","type":"text"},{"code":"belongsInSecondPartition","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". If no elements in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"collection match ","type":"text"},{"code":"belongsInSecondPartition","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the returned index is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"equal to the collection’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"endIndex","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After partitioning a collection, there is a pivot index "},{"code":"p","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no element before "},{"code":"p","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" satisfies the "},{"code":"belongsInSecondPartition","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"predicate and every element at or after "},{"code":"p","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" satisfies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"belongsInSecondPartition","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". This operation isn’t guaranteed to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stable, so the relative ordering of elements within the partitions might"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the following example, an array of numbers is partitioned by a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"predicate that matches elements greater than 30."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var numbers = [30, 40, 20, 30, 30, 60, 10]","let p = numbers.partition(by: { $0 > 30 })","\/\/ p == 5","\/\/ numbers == [30, 10, 20, 30, 30, 60, 40]"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"numbers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" array is now arranged in two partitions. The first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"partition, "},{"code":"numbers[..<p]","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", is made up of the elements that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not greater than 30. The second partition, "},{"code":"numbers[p...]","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is made up of the elements that "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"are"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" greater than 30."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let first = numbers[..<p]","\/\/ first == [30, 10, 20, 30, 30]","let second = numbers[p...]","\/\/ second == [60, 40]"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that the order of elements in both partitions changed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"That is, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"40"},{"type":"text","text":" appears before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"60"},{"type":"text","text":" in the original collection,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but, after calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"partition(by:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"60"},{"type":"text","text":" appears before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"40"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"), where ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is the length of the collection.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Complexity"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/CollectionOfOne"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"partition","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"t